{"path":"numeric/complex/abs","title":"std::abs(std::complex)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>abs<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::complex)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/complex/abs","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the magnitude of the complex number z.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/complex\">&lt;complex&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <br>T abs<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> complex<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> z <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the magnitude of the complex number <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> z\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> complex value\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>If no errors occur, returns the absolute value (also known as norm, modulus, or magnitude) of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">z</span></code>.\n</p><p>Errors and special cases are handled as if the function is implemented as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/hypot\"><span class=\"kw1339\">std::<span class=\"me2\">hypot</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex/real2\"><span class=\"kw2713\">std::<span class=\"me2\">real</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex/imag2\"><span class=\"kw2709\">std::<span class=\"me2\">imag</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;complex&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex\"><span class=\"kw1480\">std::<span class=\"me2\">complex</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> z<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> z <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" cartesian is rho = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">abs</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" theta = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex/arg\"><span class=\"kw2707\">std::<span class=\"me2\">arg</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" polar<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>(1,1) cartesian is rho = 1.41421 theta = 0.785398 polar</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex/arg\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>arg</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the phase angle <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex/polar\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>polar</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs a complex number from magnitude and phase angle <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/abs\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>abs<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(int)</span></span><span>labs</span><span>llabs</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes absolute value of an integral value (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\small{|x|}\">|x|</span>) <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/fabs\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>abs<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(float)</span></span><span>fabs</span><span>fabsf</span><span>fabsl</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  absolute value of a floating point value (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\small{|x|}\">|x|</span>) <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/hypot\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>hypot</span><span>hypotf</span><span>hypotl</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes hypotenuse <span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\scriptsize{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}\"><span class=\"t-mrad\"><span>√</span><span>x<span class=\"t-su\">2<br></span>+y<span class=\"t-su\">2<br></span></span></span></span><span class=\"t-rev-inl t-since-cxx17\"><span> and <span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\scriptsize{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2+z^2}}\"><span class=\"t-mrad\"><span>√</span><span>x<span class=\"t-su\">2<br></span>+y<span class=\"t-su\">2<br></span>+z<span class=\"t-su\">2<br></span></span></span></span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span></span></span> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/valarray/abs\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>abs<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::valarray)</span></span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  applies the function <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">abs</span></code> to each element of valarray <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/cabs\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>cabs</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library"},{"path":"numeric/complex","title":"std::complex"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::abs(std::complex)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Returns the magnitude of the complex number z."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"z"},{"label":"Return value","note":"If no errors occur, returns the absolute value (also known as norm, modulus, or magnitude) of z."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"arg","note":"returns the phase angle"},{"label":"polar","note":"constructs a complex number from magnitude and phase angle"},{"label":"abs(int), labs, llabs","note":"computes absolute value of an integral value (|x|)"},{"label":"abs(float), fabs, fabsf, …","note":"absolute value of a floating point value (|x|)"},{"label":"hypot, hypotf, hypotl","note":"computes hypotenuse √x2+y2 and √x2+y2+z2(since C++17)"},{"label":"abs(std::valarray)","note":"applies the function abs to each element of valarray"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++17"],"wordCount":171,"codeBlockCount":2}
